<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Premark Int'l started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Premark Int'l started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest said it initiated coverage of Premark International Inc as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said consistent earnings per share growth in low- to mid-teens is expected for the next several years.</p>
<p>-- said strong balance sheet gives Premark financial flexibility for share repurchases and acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Premark remained unchanged at 23-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
